# The Preferences dialog (MENU, GAME, Preferences...): pages of CheckBox items (their layout, the check
# pictures and the text drawn beside them), the buttons that choose the page (FlatButtons), and on the
# Audio/Visual page the volume bars. The page as it opens, two boxes clicked (each turns over and redraws
# its items), then the Adv., Audio/Visual and Map pages, and Cancel. Leave time after each step; the snaps
# take 2 s each.
25 load
46 click 63 538           # MENU
50 click 27 358           # GAME
54 click 190 410          # Preferences...
60 snap open
64 click 500 198          # Design units automatically
68 click 500 270          # Autosave each turn
72 snap clicked
76 click 301 192          # Adv. Preferences
80 snap advanced
84 click 301 258          # Audio/Visual Preferences
88 snap audio-visual
92 click 301 280          # Map Preferences
96 snap map
100 click 301 520         # Cancel
106 close
